  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-family: Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">마<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">마<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">과<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">칠<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xeCxCXaNvFA?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">若<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">나-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">問<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">믕ˉ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">佮<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    láng na-mn̄g~ lì kâh-goà\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">兩人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">능랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">到底<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄃᅷ`되`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">啥<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">샬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">關係<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">관ˉ헤ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    nng-láng tàu-toè siâ̰-koān-hē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">介紹<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">개`ᄉᆤ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">小妹<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">쇼ˆ뻬ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    kài-siau-lì~ si-goâ-siô-bē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">毋<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">음-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">敢<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">갈ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">講<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">坦白<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">탄ˆ벻ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    m-kâ̰-kông-thân-pêh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">雖然<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">쉬ˉ뗸-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">시ˉ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一直<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">읻ˆ딛-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">暗崁<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">암`캄</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    sūi-rien-sī~ ît-tit-àm-kham\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心內<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉ래ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">感覺<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">감ˆ각ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">真<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">진ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">難過<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">란궤</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    sīm-lāi kâm-kâk-jīn-lan-kue\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">因為<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">인ˉ위-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">踮<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">댬`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">在<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">재-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">歌壇<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">과ˉ돨ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    īn-wi-goà tiàm-jai-koā-toá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">最<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">줴`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">需要<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">수ˉᄋᆤ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">歌迷<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">과ˉ뻬ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    juè-sū-yau si-koā-bé\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">若<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">나-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">知<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">재ˆ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">有<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">우-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">女兒<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">루ˆ띠ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    láng na-jâi~ goà u-lû-rí\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">歲頭<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">훼`ᄐᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">又<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">유-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"jiâh\">遮<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\"><span style=\"font-family: Noto Sans SC\">㩼</span><rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">죄ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    huè-tháu yu-jiâh-joē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">恐驚<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">켱ˆ걀ˆ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">可比<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">코ˆ비ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">秋天<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">츄ˉ틸ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">落花<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">락ˆ훼ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    khiông-kiâ̰~ khô-pî-chiū-thḭ̂’e lâk-huê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">名聲<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">먀샬ˆ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">飄飄<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄑᆤˉᄑᆤˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">墜落<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">뒤롷-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">地<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">되ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    mia-siâ̰~ phiāu-phiāu-tui-loh-toē\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一切<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">읻ˆ체</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">시ˉ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">環境<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">환곙`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">來<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">造成<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">조솅-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">無<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">聊<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">ᄅᆤˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">命運<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">먀운ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    ît-che sī~ hoan-kièng lai-jo-sieng-bo-liáu’e mia-ūn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">滿面<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">뫄ˆ삔ˉ</rt></ruby>’에~ <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">胭脂水粉<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1em\">옌ˉ지ˉ쥐ˆ훈`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    moâ-bīn’e~ yēn-jī-jûi-hùn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">打扮<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">달ˆ반ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">當<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">등ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">青春<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">촁ˉ춘ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tâ̰-pān tn̄g-chiēng-chûn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">上<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">쥴-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">舞台<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">뿌ˆ대ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">表演<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄇᆤˆ옌ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">歌唱<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">과ˉ츌</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jiṵ-bû-tái piâu-yên-koā-chiṵ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">引<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">인ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">迷魂<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">뻬훈ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">笑文文<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">쵸`뿐뿐ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    în-láng be-hún chiò-bun-bún\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">因為<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">인ˉ위-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">踮<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">댬`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">在<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">재-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">歌壇<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">과ˉ돨ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    īn-wi-goà tiàm-jai-koā-toá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">靠<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">코`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">藝術<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">께숟-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">趁<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">탄`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">錢銀<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">질꾼ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    khò-ge-sut-thàn-jḭ-gún\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">母囝<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">뿌ˆ걀`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">來<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">相依為命<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1em\">셩ˉ이ˉ위뼹ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    bû-kià̰ lai-siōng-ī-wi-biēng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">勞苦<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">로커`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">無<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">議論<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">끼룬ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    lo-khòr bo-gi-lūn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">哪<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.3em\">나ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">通<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">탕ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">怨嘆<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">완`탄`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">無<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">情<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">졩ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">郎君<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">렁군ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    nà thāng-oàn-thàn-bo-jiéng’e long-kûn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">每日<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">뮈ˆ띧ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心肝<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉ괄ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">亂紛紛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.1em\">롼훈훈ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    mûi-rît sīm-koâ̰ loan-hun-hūn\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">興趣<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">혱`추</rt></ruby>’둏~ <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">唱歌<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">츌`과ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">來<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">래ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">짇-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">唱<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">츌</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">已經<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">이ˆ곙ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">十<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">잡-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">偌<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">똬-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">冬<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">당ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    hièng-chu’tioh~ chiṵ̀-koā-lái jit-chiṵ î-kiēng-jap-roa-tâng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">親<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\"