></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">了後<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄅᆤˆᄋᅷˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    poh-jieng-lóng~ li-khûi liâu-āu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">將<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">졍ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">著<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">둏-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">愛情<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">애`졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">全<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">좐-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">放<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">방</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jiōng-tioh-ài-jiéng lông-joan-pang\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">因為<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">인ˉ위-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">踮<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">댬`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">在<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">재-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">歌壇<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">과ˉ돨ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    īn-wi-goà tiàm-jai-koā-toá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">有<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">우-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">能力<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">롕롁ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">再<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">재`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">活動<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">왛당ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    u-lieng-liêk jài-oah-tāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">期待<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">기태ˉ</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">美麗<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">삐ˆ레-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">前程<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">졘뎽ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    ki-thāi’tio bî-le-jien-