style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一生<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">읻ˆ솅ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">願望<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">꽌빵ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    si-goâ-ît-siêng’e goan-bāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n"
